cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BDBVHubRenewal: renewal-model nowcasts and forecasts for the BDBV Modeling Hub"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abbott
    given-names: Sam
    email: sam.abbott@lshtm.ac.uk
    affiliation: London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8057-8037
abstract: >-
  Weekly nowcasts and forecasts of confirmed Bundibugyo virus disease cases
  in the Democratic Republic of the Congo for the BDBV Modeling Hub,
  nationally, by province and by health zone, with the data tools, backtest
  and automated submission workflow behind them. Two hub models are
  submitted. seabbs-rwnowcast is baselinenowcast with a random walk on top.
  seabbs-renewal carries one of three renewal models of daily onsets with a
  learnt reporting delay and the hub's imputation of missing onsets:
  renewal, with pooled Rt and gravity importation between provinces;
  renewalsp, renewal without importation; and renewalbvd, which adds the Rt
  estimates of BVDOutbreakSize.
keywords:
  - epidemiology
  - forecasting
  - nowcasting
  - hubverse
  - Bundibugyo virus disease
